{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「请进」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「能稍微打扰一下吗？」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2429", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没关系」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还以为樱乃和平时一样是来看书的，\\n但她这次并没有带书过来。", "text_idx": 154, "plain": "我还以为樱乃和平时一样是来看书的，但她这次并没有带书过来。", "plain_idx": 155, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2430", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "进来后，樱乃直直地盯着我。", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你是有什么话想说才过来的吧？」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………嗯」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2431", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "踌躇了会儿后，樱乃微微点了点头。", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是有什么烦心事吗？」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。大概是我目前为止的人生中最大的烦恼」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2432", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最大……这么严重」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，所以……我来找哥哥了」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2433", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那件事和你最近一直在看手机有关系吗？」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你注意到了吗？」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2434", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……稍微有那么一点点关系」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2435", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "人生中最大的烦恼……吗。", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说，樱乃。虽然我可能不是个很可靠的哥哥——」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": "「我说，樱乃。虽然我可能不是个很可靠的哥哥——」", "plain_idx": 177, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃用力地将我的袖口拽了过去。", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才没有那回事」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2436", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我从来没有觉得哥哥不可靠过，一次也没有」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "「我从来没有觉得哥哥不可靠过，一次也没有」", "plain_idx": 181, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2437", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……谢谢你，樱乃」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明妹妹都这么烦恼了，但是哥哥我除了看着以外什么都做不到……」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": "「明明妹妹都这么烦恼了，但是哥哥我除了看着以外什么都做不到……」", "plain_idx": 184, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正因为你是哥哥，才做不到呀」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2438", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这是什么意思。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「能稍微听我聊两句吗？」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2439", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「光是聊聊天，那要我听多久都行」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2440", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听着我的回答，樱乃沉默了许久。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "听着我的回答，樱乃沉默了许久。", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个……」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2441", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我有点不知道该怎么走下去才好」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2442", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就连之前知道该怎么做的事，现在也不知该如何是好了」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2443", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她想表达什么呢。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我不明白，但是现在樱乃不是在寻求着我的回答。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我在听」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只是在倾听着樱乃不断组织起来的话语。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我一直、一直以为这件事不会有什么变化，\\n　但是现在也许不得不做出改变了……」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": "「我一直、一直以为这件事不会有什么变化，　但是现在也许不得不做出改变了……」", "plain_idx": 204, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2444", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我明明知道，不做出点什么是不行的，但是却又什么都做不了……」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2445", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的心就仿佛迷路了一般」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2446", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「迷路了吗……」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2447", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我估计我现在理解到的部分连樱乃想表达的一半都还没到。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "我估计我现在理解到的部分连樱乃想表达的一半都还没到。", "plain_idx": 213, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我想要帮助樱乃的这份心绝不会改变。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到时候交给我不就好了」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……就像那个时候一样」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个时候？」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2448", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃迷路的那个时候」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哥哥，你还记得啊」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2449", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么可能会忘」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊……给你添了好多的麻烦」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2450", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不是啊，樱乃」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是吗？」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2451", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我当时可高兴了」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「开心？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2452", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我觉得，在那一天，我才真正成为了樱乃的“哥哥”。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "因为我觉得，在那一天，我才真正成为了樱乃的“哥哥”。", "plain_idx": 231, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是这件事没办法对樱乃讲。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我是作为哥哥，第一个找到了自己的妹妹」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2453", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。哥哥不管什么时候都能找到我」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "「是啊。哥哥不管什么时候都能找到我」", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2454", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「无论何时，只要我在等，你就会来接我」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2455", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟你是我重要的妹妹啊」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……谢谢」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2456", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃言尽于此。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概是想说的已经说完了，或者没有什么能说的了吧。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "大概是想说的已经说完了，或者没有什么能说的了吧。", "plain_idx": 243, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2457", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃就这样一直看着我。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要不，时隔多年……我们再去那儿看看吧？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回过神来我已经把话说出口了。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个时候的地方？」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2458", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2459", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回忆随着话语涌现。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从家开始走的话应该没有多远。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，要去」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2460", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自我们出生前就屹立于此的这座城镇。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那风景已经数年乃至数十年未曾一变。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "路灯微光的照射之下，道路绵延不绝，依稀可见。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这里，夜晚的黑暗……说不定比光芒更加深邃。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……即便是现在过来也是一样的黑啊」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。简直漆黑一片」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2461", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "走在旁边的樱乃，将身体稍微依靠了过来。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，这儿以前就长这样吗？」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我靠着记忆摸索着前进。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老街的路和那些大房子并排在一起。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2462", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我尝试着捋清记忆的丝线。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个时候真的是拼了命了。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "心脏像是快要裂开一般的痛，都没办法正常地呼吸，\\n但即便那样我还是没有停下步伐。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "心脏像是快要裂开一般的痛，都没办法正常地呼吸，但即便那样我还是没有停下步伐。", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不断地找，不断地找，不断地找。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当找到畏缩着蹲在那里的樱乃时，内心的那股安心劲至今我依然记着。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "当找到畏缩着蹲在那里的樱乃时，内心的那股安心劲至今我依然记着。", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……樱乃之前待的地方，应该是更往那边一点吧？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，就这样直走，\\n　在一个墙壁有些凹陷下去的地方」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "「嗯，就这样直走，　在一个墙壁有些凹陷下去的地方」", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2463", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种昏暗程度让我们自然地并肩走在了一起。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺着墙壁漫步了许久。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概，就是这附近了吧。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在我这么想的时候。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2464", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃突然发出声音停下了脚步。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是这」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2465", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "墙壁和墙壁中间。一个凹陷下去的地方。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。就是这里了」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃当时就在这里坐着，动也动不了。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我那个时候……真小」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2466", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是啊」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们对这里有着特别的感情。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那一天我们两个，就在这里成为了兄妹。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以或许是为了确认我们“兄妹”的身份吧，\\n我们二人又一次回到了这里。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "所以或许是为了确认我们“兄妹”的身份吧，我们二人又一次回到了这里。", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，刚才那话题的后续……你愿意继续听我说吗？」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2467", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「至今为止最大的烦恼？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2468", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。只要你愿意说」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我希望你听听」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk2469", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
